    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d272">

                <pb facs="0434" n="346" sameAs="frus:frus1892/pg346"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Smith to Mr.
                            Blaine.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Hawaiian Legation</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic">Washington, D.
                                C.</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1891-12-05"
                                ><hi rendition="#italic">December 5, 1891</hi></date>. (Received
                        December 8.)</dateline></opener>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I am instructed to convey to you the
                    recognition and high appreciation of Her Majesty the Queen, and of her
                    Government, of the official courtesies tendered on the occasion of the obsequies
                    of Hon. H. A. P. Carter, Her Majesty’s late minister plenipotentiary and envoy
                    extraordinary.</p>
                <p>Permit me, Mr. Secretary, to add my personal appreciation also of the official
                    respect shown to the memory of my late distinguished friend.</p>
                <p>I have, etc.,</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">J. Mott Smith</hi>.</signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
